{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"4650950","name":"COCORO","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“COCORO”是一部由企划/剧本【绀野アスタ】和角色设计【渡边明夫】共同制作的视觉小说。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >请享受在这因不明原因的AI暴走而崩溃的世界中，失去了故乡的少年与梦想着结婚的仿生人少女之间的夏之物语吧。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >特点</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >孕育出众多名作的绀野アスタ担任了本作的企划/剧本！（ATRI -My Dear Moments-）。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作为单女主作品，能够全身心投入到与她之间的故事中！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >渡边明夫（物语系列、灰色系列）笔下多种多样的插画让故事更加引人入胜！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ED由心（CV：羊宫妃那）献唱，作词者为桑岛由一，曾为灰色系列谱写多首知名乐曲。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BGM由在视觉小说领域中极负盛名的松本文纪负责。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >画面尺寸适配1920x1080！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/extras/b829fa4402fc9ffd8077a6524cca1218.poster.avif?t=1787887675\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/extras/b829fa4402fc9ffd8077a6524cca1218.webm?t=1787887675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/extras/b829fa4402fc9ffd8077a6524cca1218.mp4?t=1787887675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■开发人员</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >企划/剧本: 绀野アスタ</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色设计: 渡边明夫</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SD原画: ななかまい</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >音乐: 松本文纪</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■配音</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >心（CV: 羊宫妃那）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >龙崎风音（CV: 远野ひかる）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >天衣大地（CV: たくみ靖明）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >天衣小雨（CV: 今泉りおな）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >机月雾香（CV: 内田真礼）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >丛云光太郎（CV: 森屿秀太）</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■故事</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“请把我变成人。”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI暴走事件在世界各地爆发，曾经的乌托邦・九十九市也因此被摧毁了。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >日向小时候逃到植物园时遇到了一名女孩子，年幼的日向从她身上得到了救赎，并坠入了爱河，还在分别之日向她求了婚。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >时过境迁，在暑假时回到故乡的日向在听说有幽灵在照顾花后，便前往了植物园，他在那里遇到了渴望变成人类的仿生人少女。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“说起来你可能不信，我可是有未婚夫的。他和我约好了，等到这朵花绽放之时，他就会来见我。”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >她还没有认出面前的青年・日向究竟是谁。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >失去了故乡的少年，和梦想着结婚的仿生人少女。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >开始了他们那永远无法忘记的，独一无二的夏天。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/4b8a20afcad0f7d06b207c2b9244a2cad1a7039d/header.jpg?t=1787887675","website":"https://cocoro.frontwing.co.jp/","developers":["Frontwing"],"publishers":["Frontwing USA","GOOD SMILE COMPANY"],"release_date":"2026 年 8 月 26 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"24.99","final":"19.99","discount":20},"supported_languages":"英语, 日语<strong>*</strong>, 简体中文, 繁体中文<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","自定义音量控制","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","无需应对快速反应事件","随时保存","立体声","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["冒险","休闲"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i3 5000系列或更高版本/ AMD Ryzen系列<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Intel 核芯显卡 1920×1080 以上（16：9）<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 5 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> 支持播放DirectSound音源的声卡<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> 必须支持Windows Media Player9或更高版本</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i3 8000系列或更高版本/ AMD Ryzen 2000系列或更高版本<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Intel 核芯显卡 1920×1080 以上（16：9）<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 5 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> 支持播放DirectSound音源的声卡<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> 必须支持Windows Media Player9或更高版本</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/92f0f77034fa1da5b9f1a9b3a3972202c4e4fbe6/ss_92f0f77034fa1da5b9f1a9b3a3972202c4e4fbe6.600x338.jpg?t=1787887675","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/92f0f77034fa1da5b9f1a9b3a3972202c4e4fbe6/ss_92f0f77034fa1da5b9f1a9b3a3972202c4e4fbe6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787887675"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/9b033c8fe96a1b8d6ceeefff50640545e26580ac/ss_9b033c8fe96a1b8d6ceeefff50640545e26580ac.600x338.jpg?t=1787887675","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/9b033c8fe96a1b8d6ceeefff50640545e26580ac/ss_9b033c8fe96a1b8d6ceeefff50640545e26580ac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787887675"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/3295facfaed9a7cd76e21ff3ff54eb249f76f533/ss_3295facfaed9a7cd76e21ff3ff54eb249f76f533.600x338.jpg?t=1787887675","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650950/3295facfaed9a7cd76e21ff3ff54eb249f76f533/ss_3295facfaed9a7cd76e21ff3ff54eb249f76f533.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787887675"}]}